","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The three Dolls read the decrypted letter again and again. Their glimmering eyes all settle on the name \"Leinad Kcaj\", signed in cursive."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_TheUniverse-TheWheelofFortune","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The person who wrote the letter, this \"Leinad Kcaj\", believes that there are different world lines in this universe. In other words, there is a Griffin, a Commander, and an AR Team in another world... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But a world line would split into multiple lines whenever a choice is made, and events develop differently down different lines."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"If we'd made all the right choices, M16, M4, and the Commander could still be alive..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"Shake"}],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Is that really possible?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The events are already set in stone in our world, but perhaps in another world..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That's assuming what this \"Leinad Kcaj\" said is true."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"te